  "prefLabel": "Agr 503.11 Information About Honey, Honey Products and Honey Flavored Products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 503.11 Information About Honey, Honey Products and Honey Flavored Products.\n\n(a) The information submitted about honey and honey products shall include the USDA grade, if known.\n\n(b) The information submitted about honey flavored products shall comply with RSA 429:22, II.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09",
